OL,3,GNEWSA'Dishonest' police officers guilty
OL,4,Aof misconduct over fatal crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo police officers who lied about
OL,7,Fcarrying out missing person searches
OL,8,Fregarding a crash in which three people
OL,9,Fdied have been found guilty at a police
OL,10,Fmisconduct hearing.
OL,12,FPC Richard Hardwick and PC Lauren
OL,13,FLivingstone faced gross misconduct
OL,14,Fallegations over their actions before a
OL,15,Fcar carrying five people was found
OL,16,Fcrashed two days later in a woodland in
OL,17,FSt Mellons, Cardiff, in 2023.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
