OL,3,GNEWSA'Dishonest' police officers guilty
OL,4,Aof misconduct over fatal crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe hearing in Newport was told they
OL,7,Fwere "dishonest" in official logs and
OL,8,Fto a senior officer by claiming
OL,9,Fsearches of the homes of Eve Smith, who
OL,10,Fdied, and Sophie Russon had been
OL,11,Fcarried out.
OL,13,FHardwick and Livingstone's punishment
OL,14,Fis expected to be heard on Friday
OL,15,Fafternoon.
